<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issues.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issues.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said on Wednesday that on November 21 it will redeem $1.4 million in four debenture issues as follows.</p>
<p>  Principal  Interest   Maturity     Cusip</p>
<p> $50 million    6.34     7/03/98   3134A0DH2</p>
<p> $45 million    6.35     6/24/98   3134A0CY6</p>
<p> $35 million   6.945     5/31/00   3134A0BF8</p>
<p> $10 million    6.94     8/14/00   3134A0GS5</p>
<p>Freddie Mac said it will redeem the issues in their entirety at a price equal to 100 percent of principal. It will pay principal plus accrued interest to the redemption date to holders of record as of the close of business on November 20.</p>
</text>
